[{"id":"cf15549a78fc52598ddd1951f321c58372bbd64f","title":"Add Typed Decisions benchmark eval results (#4)","message":"\n\n\n- Add Typed Decisions benchmark eval results (0cc2374f389e6536b72c10d95a6b24f5c0551794)\n\n\nCo-authored-by: Nathan Habib <SaylorTwift@users.noreply.huggingface.co>\n","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"},{"user":"SaylorTwift","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/1678663263366-63e0eea7af523c37e5a77966.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-17T15:02:22.000Z"},{"id":"225be8b1e2270becab69c5fe05b26f99cbbdd66b","title":"Card: add Run with vLLM","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-15T07:19:31.000Z"},{"id":"bb1a602d5855c1115a28f082f7d62dc148c93124","title":"Card: link the free API at decision.vllm-sr.ai and the official Space","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-15T05:15:15.000Z"},{"id":"156a6d9330277b7e1a6571a1d881b516e7e1ea15","title":"Runtime: loading checks only the files the runtime reads","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-14T17:14:52.000Z"},{"id":"2fe35d17963c63df628f10dae449eedd3fbe9490","title":"Card: Engine mode batches by default; engine arguments replace runtime profiles","message":"\n\nNames the two measured Engine mode setups for what they were: one request per forward, the former default (exact in the chart), and batching, the default in vLLM Semantic Router from main. The engine arguments --max-num-batched-tokens, --max-num-seqs, --batch-window-ms and --dtype replace the --runtime-profile flag. README.md only; every measured number is unchanged.","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-14T13:36:13.000Z"},{"id":"fc2d74bd48ec29ae42d4330a543913f7858e3f40","title":"Card: official Jev Decision Index 0.3.2 results and serving performance","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-13T10:20:10.000Z"},{"id":"093cffbaa7be6f5dfe14252ae7e80c396c06dbd9","title":"Runtime: faster System One server replies","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-12T12:03:13.000Z"},{"id":"2de0bddea6210e674ada194e142343e5b95ea55c","title":"Runtime: simpler System One server","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-12T10:04:41.000Z"},{"id":"5ce995dfb7ff07da00fec4211eb7f0560f52eaf8","title":"Card: shorter vLLM Semantic Router command","message":"\n\nThe \"Run with vLLM Semantic Router\" section now uses `vllm-sr serve -e vllm-sr/d3`: the platform is detected automatically, and one line lists the `--platform` values (auto, cpu, cuda, rocm; default auto). The parity sentence keeps its measurement context (AMD Instinct MI325X). MODEL_MANIFEST.json records the new README.md (SHA-256 and size) in the same commit. Weights, runtime files and the v3.1.0 tag are unchanged.","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-12T07:26:05.000Z"},{"id":"7f257ad70fea337c1d88ec037f8a79b07e75f210","title":"Card: run with vLLM Semantic Router (Engine mode)","message":"\n\nAdds the \"Run with vLLM Semantic Router\" section: install the vllm-sr CLI from the development channel, `vllm-sr serve vllm-sr/d3 --engine --platform rocm`, and text, image and video requests to the System One API. MODEL_MANIFEST.json records the new README.md (SHA-256 and size) in the same commit. Weights, runtime files and the v3.1.0 tag are unchanged.","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-12T06:45:22.000Z"},{"id":"cbff3a3cb0b074b6585fe9f747b9f9f5557a0e75","title":"d3 v3.1.0","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-11T04:54:24.000Z"},{"id":"a443f814cedfb5525550e6b8ea0770fccce95ec8","title":"d3 v3.0.6","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-11T02:32:32.000Z"},{"id":"3d309f396ca6632c1931668e792cd6b738a73220","title":"d3 v3.0.5","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-11T00:49:45.000Z"},{"id":"2b02c42acac8a2ce7bc2144c7e4d24e9be17c4ae","title":"d3 v3.0.4","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-10T23:22:32.000Z"},{"id":"dc6c41cb98429ea8fc30e5bfb04b75757222575c","title":"d3 v3.0.3","message":"","authors":[{"user":"Xunzhuo","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/66f8caead3186746f4524419/pxKL-C06JDIABl5JelJbr.jpeg"}],"date":"2026-10-10T20:46:33.000Z"},{"id":"ec58e482c5e00256ac1970bffe4b8b0c45ddd59b","title":"Card: remove pending-evaluation 